        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Generate then Upscale a Poster\n\nGenerates a poster at low resolution and upscales only the version you keep. Drafting at 1K and upscaling once costs far less than generating every draft at full size.\n\n**How it works:** \"Prompt\" holds a description of a retro travel poster. \"Draft\" generates a 3:4 image at 1K from it. \"Upscale 2x\" doubles its resolution, and \"Poster\" shows the result. Pick a model on \"Draft\" before running.\n\n**Try this:** Change the \"Prompt\" text to your own poster idea, or set the \"Draft\" aspect ratio to 2:3 for a taller print."
        },
